Package: aurora-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: gpgv, python3, ${misc:Depends}
Description: archive key, apt guard and package pin of Aurora's Debian testing packages
 The public key that signs Aurora's Debian testing package repository, an apt
 preference (priority 990) that keeps Aurora's builds of Debian packages
 installed in place of Debian's own, and an apt hook that enforces channel
 binding, freshness and a monotonic snapshot generation floor.
